## Request

Freeze the state semantics exposed by the previous Work5 releases. Document lifecycle, outcome
disposition, reconciliation, and recursive closure remain separate dimensions, but closeout gates
and user-facing claims must not imply convergence that has not occurred.

Extend controlled discovery beyond promoted Ideas so equivalent Map, PRM, campaign, and other
applicable document drift is detected with stable reason codes. Make the normal terminal transition
path update or validate the corresponding document lifecycle and body status coherently, including
safe recovery from interruption. Strengthen release finalization to check the recursive-closure and
document conditions required by the owning scope.

Use the six observed Map/PRM rows as classification fixtures: MAP-0025, MAP-0027, PRM-0036, and
PRM-0038 are terminal, reconciled, and effectively closed; MAP-0026 and PRM-0037 remain recursively
open and must not be treated as equivalent automatic repairs. Preserve IDEA-0021. This campaign
implements prevention and detection only; CAMP-0160 and CAMP-0161 own utility construction and
historical application, CAMP-0162 owns projections, and later milestones own qualification and
release.

